WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.320
- I think that we love this though.

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.940
You love hot dogs, and I love hot dogs.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.773
- I do love hot dogs.

00:00:03.773 --> 00:00:04.606
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:04.606 --> 00:00:05.439
- I do, yeah.

00:00:05.439 --> 00:00:06.780
- [Kelly] Why, when did
this start, this passion?

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:07.620
- [Brie] Oh gosh, yeah.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.270
When did my love with affair
with the hot dog begin?

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.320
Well, I've always loved hot dogs,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.760
but my best friend, Courtney McBroom,

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.950
who's also the food consultant on...

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:15.060
Oh yeah, you can see it right there.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.050
- [Kelly] In Lessons in Chemistry.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.550
- [Brie] Yeah, food consultant
on Lessons in Chemistry.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.110
She started, she's the president

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:20.490
of the Hot Dog Appreciation Club.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.323
And I'm a proud member, obviously.

00:00:21.323 --> 00:00:22.650
- [Kelly] Nice, nice.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.080
- Yes, and so this is segued into

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.670
a hot dog appreciation festival.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.440
That's once a year at my family's house.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.900
My step dad dressed as a hot dog.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.010
It's a lot, but it's, it's a
really great, it's super fun.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.510
Oh yeah you can see it all going down.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.820
- [Kelly] So I hear you have
a debate with that fanny pack.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:39.653
Get it.

00:00:39.653 --> 00:00:40.486
- [Brie] Oh no, we're gonna get into this.

00:00:40.486 --> 00:00:42.120
- I hear there's a debate, yeah.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.830
- Okay, let's get into
the heart of the issue.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.120
- If the hotdog is a sandwich

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.310
or if it's separate, if
it's a hot dog, it's not.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.650
- [Brie] I think a hot dog is a hot dog.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:53.490
I think to say that it is
a sandwich is blasphemy.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.890
But Courtney thinks that it's a sandwich.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:57.150
And it's very hard to argue with someone

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:59.670
who is the president of a
Hot Dog Appreciation Club.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:01.230
It's like, why am I fighting reality?

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:02.310
I don't know, it's kind of fun.

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.390
- You know what's funny is I don't,

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.223
I've never thought about it.

00:01:04.223 --> 00:01:05.490
Maybe y'all have, but I've
never thought about it.

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:08.940
But it is bread with meat in between.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:10.470
- [Brie] I know, but it's connected,

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.026
and that makes all the difference.

00:01:12.026 --> 00:01:13.440
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.290
- Okay, okay, okay, okay, okay, okay.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.360
But what about a subway sandwich?

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.340
Like a, you know, that's a sub.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:21.540
It's connected.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.454
Am I blowing your mind right now?

00:01:22.454 --> 00:01:23.287
- It's not, it's not connected,

00:01:23.287 --> 00:01:24.634
it's not connected, it's not connected.

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:25.691
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:25.691 --> 00:01:27.237
- All right, no.
- I just wanna see.

00:01:27.237 --> 00:01:28.070
- You're totally right.
- Show of hands.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.670
How many people, I won't be
offended, I'm just curious.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.490
How many people think a
hot dog is a sandwich?

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:33.323
See, the people who say no-

00:01:33.323 --> 00:01:34.380
- [Kelly] We're alone.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.060
- [Brie] are emphatic that it's a no.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:37.260
And we don't even really know why,

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:38.430
but it's just wrong.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:39.660
But I'm very proud of the like

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.220
five people that stood
strong in their belief

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.053
that it's a sandwich.

00:01:42.053 --> 00:01:42.886
- [Kelly] Yes, thank
you, you stood with me,

00:01:42.886 --> 00:01:44.658
we were alone on an island, but it's okay.

00:01:44.658 --> 00:01:45.491
(Brie laughing)

00:01:45.491 --> 00:01:46.500
I never thought about it before.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.333
And then I was like,

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:48.970
well it kind of is like
a sub sandwich, kind of.

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:49.803
- [Brie] It's thought provoking.

00:01:49.803 --> 00:01:50.636
- Yeah.

00:01:50.636 --> 00:01:51.469
- It's thought provoking for sure.

00:01:51.469 --> 00:01:52.890
- [Kelly] Thought provoking, well...

